<messaging:emailTemplate subject="BIC Graphic PO# {!relatedTo.EBS_PO_Number__c} Order on Hold Clarification Required. Case #{!relatedTo.CaseNumber}, Order #{!relatedTo.EBS_Order_Number__c}, {!relatedTo.ThreadID_FK__c}" 
recipientType="Contact"  relatedToType="case">

    <messaging:htmlEmailBody >

<html>

<style>
body {font-family: 'source sans pro';}
</style>


<span style="font-size:8px;"><img src="https://bicgraphic--c.documentforce.com/file-asset-public/BG_Logo?oid=00DU8000002Zr1t" style="max-width: 840.197px; width: 140.998px; height: 25.9981px;" title="BIC Graphic Logo" /></span><br />
<span style="font-size:8px"></span><b><span style="color:#ffc107"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">|</span></span></b><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family: source sans pro"><span style="font-size: 12px"> The Best Brands in the Business<b>&nbsp;</b></span></span></span><b><span style="color:#ffc107"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">|</span></span><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family: source sans pro, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></span></b>&nbsp;

<br/><br/>


<p>Thanks for ordering from BIC Graphic! Your order is temporarily on hold.</p>
 <p><b>We can’t wait to complete your order but need to talk to you first about the order below:</b></p>
    
   <li> Customer Name: {!relatedTo.SuppliedCompany}</li>
    

    <li>Customer Number: {!relatedTo.EBS_Account_Number__c}</li>
    <li>PO Number: {!relatedTo.EBS_PO_Number__c}</li>
     <li>Order Number: {!relatedTo.EBS_Order_ID__c}</li>
     <li>Date: {!relatedTo.Clarification_Start_Date__c}</li>
     <li>Contact: {!relatedTo.Contact.name}</li>
     <li>Phone: {!relatedTo.ContactPhone}</li>
     <li>Ship to:<!--donot see any field ship to in case?--></li>
     
<br/><br/><br/><c:clarificationQuestions rcaseID="{!relatedTo}"/>     
    
   

<p>You can continue to track this order right on our website! It’s quick and easy when you <a href="https://www.bicgraphic.com/US/login">log in</a>  to<br/> your account or <a href="https://www.bicgraphic.com/US/RegisterCustomerAccount">create a login</a> at <a href="https://linkprotect.cudasvc.com/url?a=http%3a%2f%2fwww.bicgraphic.com&amp;c=E,1,RSHyRGRSU_HM5UwVlcvcLAvN46Oi2USrS1x_vOlFPyA1ub67wthQhaxFnltmUfMEkBiyy_SfDlmhvN2rw1E9xbIn3vH7Wz7XqIgRclBx50yAfPncCE3sn6CQ9uE,&amp;typo=1">www.bicgraphic.com</a>.</p>

<p>All the best, <br/>
The BIC Graphic Customer Care Team<br/></p>



<a href="https://www.bicgraphic.com/US/" style="text-decoration:none;color:#ffc107;font-size:18px;font-family:Source Sans Pro Black,sans-serif;">bicgraphic.com</a><br />
<span style="font-size:11px"><span style="color:black"><span style="line-height:.7;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif">You can check order status and inventory, estimate shipping, create a virtual sample or access case studies, test reports, images and templates. It&rsquo;s all there!</span></span></span>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
